#!/usr/local/bin/dyalogscript
⍝ Tests of the web front end (web/WebTests.apln). Run from the project root: ./web/test.apls
⍝ Prints the names of failing tests, or "web tests pass". Needs web/static/client.* only for TestStatic.
⎕IO←0
root←⊃1⎕NPARTS''
'Conga'#.⎕CY'conga'
z←{2⎕FIX'file://',root,⍵}¨'src/Othello.apln' 'src/Games.apln' 'ui/App.apln' 'web/Remote.aplc' 'web/Server.aplc' 'web/WebTests.apln'
f←#.WebTests.RunTests 0
⎕←(0=≢f)⊃('failing: ',⍕f)'web tests pass'
